# Where landing-page beta requests are delivered.
# Without this the request form only writes to the visitor's own browser and you
# will never see the lead. Point it at a hosted form endpoint that accepts JSON
# (Formspree, Tally, Basin, …), e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx
# VITE_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=

# Optional. Shown as a fallback address if a request cannot be delivered.
# VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=

# Future hosted auth (not wired yet — current beta gate uses localStorage)
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Existing render server
# VITE_RENDER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
